PrintLab
========

PrintLab is a modified version of Bambuddy (https://github.com/maziggy/bambuddy),
based on Bambuddy 1.2.5.7. Bambuddy is copyright (C) its authors and contributors
and is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications (2026, Luk1236): rebranding as PrintLab, German default UI and
Prusa-style theme, maintenance programs, door and plate changer, camera
calibration and image checks, quote calculator, PC slicer service, access guard.
The full list is in FORK-CHANGELOG.md; the Git history shows every change.

